0..78 Comment "// A view of a value held inside a scope, kept at its own hold, as Rust lets a"
79..156 Comment "// reference to a block\'s local live as long as the block: `{ let x = 42; let"
157..233 Comment "// r = &x; *r }`. A shared view kept in a region keeps its held value frozen"
234..311 Comment "// until the region ends, so a slot held inside the scope is kept at the hold"
312..329 Comment "// that holds it."
331..409 Comment "/// Keeps a view of a value held inside the handler at the hold, and forces it"
410..435 Comment "/// before the hold ends."
